I've updated my label-reading patch.
(http://www.greyfire.org/~l/labelread.diff) Now, you can attempt to
(r)ead the writing on the following items:

* Credit cards.
* Magic markers.
* Zorkmids.
* Runed objects. (but only if your character can read Elvish.)
* The Orb of Fate.

These objects return the message "This __ has no label" when read:
* Tins.
* Candy bars.
* Cans of grease.

Note: If your character can read Elvish, you'll find that the runes on
"runed broadswords" only spell the name of the elven weaponsmith
responsible for the sword.

Runeswords, however, are inscribed with no language known on the
surface world. (A question for the audience: do the runes on
Stormbringer spell anything?)

